define episode_tool_schema returning Str:
    return "{\"type\":\"function\",\"function\":{\"name\":\"memory_timeline\",\"description\":\"Read source-backed private episodic memories chronologically. Start with cursor=\\\"\\\", choose entries and optional category (empty means all), then pass next_cursor until end. Cursor fixes the ingestion boundary; restart to include later memories. Reported event dates sort first by their actual timestamp; undated accounts use source-recording time explicitly labelled as such, and wholly unknown dates sort last. This does not invent when an experience happened. Returns original event/digest/session/project, ingestion time, evidence labels and correction links. Superseded records are history, not current facts. Current permissions and forgetting still apply on each page. Page size is caller-selected, with no artificial maximum.\",\"parameters\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"cursor\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"entries\":{\"type\":\"integer\",\"minimum\":1},\"category\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"cursor\",\"entries\",\"category\"],\"additionalProperties\":false}}}"
